  <Docs>
    <summary>Captures a planned exercise session, also commonly referred to as a training plan.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Captures a planned exercise session, also commonly referred to as a training plan.</para>
      <para>Each record contains a start time, end time, an exercise type and a list of <c>PlannedExerciseBlock</c> which describe the details of the planned session. The start and end times
            may be in the future.</para>
      <para>
        <format type="text/html">
          <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/health/connect/datatypes/PlannedExerciseSessionRecord" title="Reference documentation">Java documentation for <code>android.health.connect.datatypes.PlannedExerciseSessionRecord</code>.</a>
        </format>
